# OpenRouteService API key -- enables real road routing and route geometry.
#
# Get a free key at https://openrouteservice.org/dev/#/signup
# The free tier allows ~2,000 requests/day, which is ample for this project.
#
# Copy this file to `.env` and paste your key below.
#
# Without a key the application still works: the routing layer falls back to
# straight-line distance scaled by a circuity factor fitted from the taxi
# meter data, and every response is flagged `route_is_estimate: true`.
ORS_API_KEY=your_key_here
